Exclusion Criteria:

1. People who have received CAR-T therapy or other gene-modified cell therapy;
2. Patients with BMS with clinical symptoms or lesions located in key parts of the brain at the time of screening, patients with BMS without clinical symptoms or lesions located in non-critical parts of the brain should be evaluated by researchers or specialists to gain more than the risk.
